    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Root cause confirmed and removed: the collectible/location linkages had been put back onto the already-rejected standalone lex_blips dictionary, so the map rendered them as black quads. Every custom map texture now lives in one complete resident INVENTORY_ITEMS_MP archive containing all 432 Rockstar textures plus all 13 custom textures. Every custom linkage—including corpse and animal-skin overrides—now points there. lex_blips.ytd has been removed from both live loader paths and from the installer. Source and installed archive/blipdata hashes match. Because YTD/blipdata are startup-loaded, the corrected icons appear after the next normal full game restart.",
